   "summary": "SSC Space and Andøya Space have signed a Memorandum of Understanding to strengthen cooperation in orbital launch services and develop an integrated Arctic space ecosystem. The partnership will combine the companies' complementary capabilities in Sweden and Norway to support safe, reliable, resilient and competitive access to space for European and international customers.",
